
## API Endpoints

### Authentication
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Driver login (PIN + Forte ID)
- `GET /api/auth/me` - Get current user
- `POST /api/auth/register-client` - Register OBU client

### Sessions
- `GET /api/sessions` - List all sessions (fleet view)
- `GET /api/sessions/:clientId` - Get session details
- `PATCH /api/sessions/:clientId` - Update session
- `DELETE /api/sessions/:clientId` - Terminate session
- `POST /api/sessions/:clientId/advance-stop` - Manual stop advance
- `POST /api/sessions/:clientId/door-toggle` - Door control

### Messages
- `GET /api/messages` - List messages
- `POST /api/messages` - Send message
- `PATCH /api/messages/:id/acknowledge` - Acknowledge message
- `GET /api/canned-options` - Get canned messages/announcements

### Routes & Timetables
- `GET /api/routes` - List routes
- `POST /api/routes` - Create route
- `GET /api/timetables` - List timetables
- `POST /api/timetables` - Create timetable

### Dispatcher
- `GET /api/dispatcher/fleet` - Fleet overview (active/idle/non-active)
- `POST /api/dispatcher/broadcast` - Send broadcast popup
- `POST /api/dispatcher/truncate-stops` - Truncate remaining stops
- `POST /api/dispatcher/schedule-override` - Force delay adjustment
- `POST /api/dispatcher/relief-run` - Create relief run
- `POST /api/dispatcher/terminate-session` - Force logout

### Data Import
- `POST /api/gtfs/import` - Import GTFS zip
- `POST /api/csv/import` - Import custom CSV

### Admin (SYSADMIN only)
- `GET /api/admin/users` - List users
- `POST /api/admin/users` - Create user
- `PUT /api/admin/users/:id` - Update user
- `DELETE /api/admin/users/:id` - Delete user

## WebSocket Events

### Client → Server
- `register-client` - Register OBU client ID
- `update-position` - Update stop index & delay
- `send-message` - Send canned message
- `acknowledge-message` - Acknowledge received message
- `panic` - Emergency panic button

### Server → Client
- `new-message` - Incoming message
- `message-sent` - Confirmation
- `session-updated` - Session data changed
- `stop-advanced` - Stop index changed
- `door-state-changed` - Door toggle
- `dispatch-popup` - Dispatcher broadcast
- `stops-truncated` - Stops removed
- `schedule-override` - Delay changed
- `session-terminated` - Force logout

### Dispatcher Events
- `fleet-update` - Fleet state changes
- `panic-alert` - Emergency alerts
- `message-queued` - Offline message queued

## PIS (Passenger Information System)

Each OBU runs a local PIS server on port 8080:
- `http://<obu-ip>:8080/passenger-display?clientId=OBU-001`
- Real-time display of line, destination, next stop, stop list, clock
- Auto-refreshes every 5 seconds
- Responsive design for platform displays

